{"kind": "mod", "id": 1474, "name": "Disable Traitor Scavs", "slug": "disable-traitor-scavs", "teaser": "Disables Traitor Scavs. You can also, alternatively, adjust the chance they do spawn instead of disabling them. Stop getting shot in the back!", "owner_name": "acidphantasm", "downloads": 10853, "favourites": 19, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.acidphantasm.disabletraitorscavs", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-08-09T06:02:27.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-06-08T23:28:04.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-06-08T23:28:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "2.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download DisableTraitorScavs</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from 7-zip into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"wMIskD3.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-disabletraitorscavs</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">CONFIG</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Config settings (\\config\\config.jsonc)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>disableTraitorScavs</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Default: true</strong></li>\n<li><em>Change this to enable/disable traitor scavs</em></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>traitorScavChance</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Default: 15</strong></li>\n<li><em>Percentage chance to spawn a traitor scav if above setting is false.</em></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 232, "published_at": "2024-06-08T23:28:04.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1474/disable-traitor-scavs/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 192, "published_at": "2024-06-09T20:20:19.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1474/disable-traitor-scavs/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 749, "published_at": "2024-06-10T05:57:34.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1474/disable-traitor-scavs/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1924, "published_at": "2024-07-06T19:54:25.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1474/disable-traitor-scavs/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1530, "published_at": "2024-11-26T15:05:54.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1474/disable-traitor-scavs